!Tursib.Contracts/
!Tursib.Contracts/**
!TursibIngestion/
!TursibIngestion/**
!TursibIngestion.Tests/
!TursibIngestion.Tests/**
!infra/
!infra/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!.github/
!.github/**
!render.yaml
!CLAUDE.md
!docker-compose.yml
!.dockerignore
!Lucrare_Licenta_Lavu_Cristian_Ioan_IMBUNATATITA.docx
!Lucrare_Licenta_IMBUNATATITA.md

# Sensitive files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Frontend dependencies and build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Common logs and OS files
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

